   - update `architecture/index.md`
   - session: `memory-bank/integration/van/van-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md` + L + next
4. L1–L4 (integration gates)
5. **FINISH:** @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-block.mdc (`code_changed: no`)
6. Next: L1 → IMPLEMENT; L2+ → GAP (если нет свежего) → PLAN → DECOMPOSE

**Верификация**: gates + полный architecture set + mermaid minimum
